<title>MALAYSIA: Hai-O Enterprise shares to be listed Dec.</title>
<headline>Hai-O Enterprise shares to be listed Dec.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian Hai-O Enterprise Bhd's shares are to be listed on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) on Friday December 6, the KLSE said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The entire issued and paid-up share capital of 19.8 million shares of 1.0 ringgit each will be listed on the KLSE's Second Board, the Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
